  "reflectionText": "The eunuch read aloud from Isaiah in his chariot, and Philip ran up beside him and explained Jesus. They came to water by the road. The eunuch was baptized and went on his way rejoicing. How does the road open to baptism when the water you needed was already running beside where you were going?"
